Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.89,0:00:04.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.35,0:00:06.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:09.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.36,0:00:13.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.68,0:00:15.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你小子去哪了  小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell are you, Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.01,0:00:16.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.40,0:00:17.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你听上去不像没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't sound okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.52,0:00:19.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也解决不了我的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I have, you can't help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.56,0:00:20.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please tell Sam...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.95,0:00:24.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗威娜拿着《诅咒之书》和法典逃跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rowena escaped with The Book of the Damned and the codex.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.72,0:00:26.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她的名字是阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her name is Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.23,0:00:32.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是联系在一起的  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're bound, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.41,0:00:33.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会永远联系在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll always be bound.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.91,0:00:35.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你帮助过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You helped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.22,0:00:37.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们永远都会帮助彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will always help each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.38,0:00:39.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿玛拉应该就是黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think Amara is the Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.26,0:00:40.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.34,0:00:41.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管那房子里的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever's in that house,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.28,0:00:45.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能嗅到它辐射出来的法力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can taste the power radiating from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.02,0:00:44.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.45,0:00:47.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它很古老  很深\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's old, deep...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.89,0:00:49.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.00,0:00:52.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.36,0:00:54.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去看那个吃灵魂的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}To see the child that eats souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.57,0:00:55.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别碰她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay away from her!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.52,0:01:02.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想要那个孩子  而我总能如愿以偿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want that child, and I get what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.78,0:01:08.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天呐  瞧瞧你长成了这么个小可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}My, haven't you grown into a sweet young thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.59,0:01:11.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我感到咒语陷得越来越深\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel the spell just cutting deeper and deeper,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.82,0:01:12.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想抵抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm trying to fight it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.79,0:01:14.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我尽力抵抗的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.95,0:01:25.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.05,0:01:41.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要叫所有人知道我们的厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they shall know us far and wide
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.15,0:01:43.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,惧怕我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and fear us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.89,0:01:45.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we shall be known as...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.11,0:01:50.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,超大巫师团\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Mega Coven!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.34,0:01:56.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,超大巫师团\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mega Coven.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.34,0:01:58.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们比大巫师团大\N{\fnArial\fs30}See because it's greater than Grand Coven,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.06,0:02:00.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以不叫大巫师团  叫超大\N{\fnArial\fs30}so it's not grand, it's mega.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.70,0:02:03.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是超大巫师团  你们没听懂吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the Mega Coven. I don't think you're followin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.42,0:02:05.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们为什么要加入你这个巫师团啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why ever would we join you in such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.68,0:02:08.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你们那个大巫师团已经没救了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that grand coven of yours is obsolete.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.23,0:02:09.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还不明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.66,0:02:14.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自从女祭司奥莉薇特消失后它就四分五裂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And utterly falling apart since the High Priestess Olivette disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.15,0:02:16.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们听说那可能跟你有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wich we hear you may have had a hand in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.96,0:02:18.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闲言碎语罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Idle gossip.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.30,0:02:19.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,少说废话了  罗威娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut the crap, Rowena.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.91,0:02:22.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你只是想寻求保护  躲避温家那对猎人兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just looking for protection from the hunter Winchesters
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.87,0:02:25.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和其他你数目众多的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all the rest of your many enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.73,0:02:30.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  你没胆也没能力做到这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, honey, you don't have the guts or the chops to pull this off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.89,0:02:33.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以咱们就别自欺欺人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's not kid ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.04,0:02:33.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.09,0:02:39.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恰巧  我杀了地狱之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}It so happens, I killed the king of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.59,0:02:45.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我亲儿子  地狱之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}My own son, the king of hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.07,0:02:47.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是控制了一个天使去动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}and compelled an angel to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.92,0:02:51.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,胆量  能力  要我说我都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guts? Chops? I'd say that qualifies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.85,0:02:56.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有个朋友昨天才跟克劳力做了笔交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a friend, who cut a deal with Crowley only yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.94,0:02:59.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他看上去不像死了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley didn't look so dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.26,0:03:00.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.18,0:03:02.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还像以前一样想入非非  我们走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're as delusional as ever. We'll be going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.67,0:03:04.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想入非非\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delusional?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.96,0:03:06.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们走着瞧吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.15,0:03:11.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.44,0:03:24.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他没死啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.47,0:03:33.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第11季第3集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.87,0:03:58.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最后一个邻居也问过了  跟其他的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, that was the last of the neighbours, just like the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.33,0:04:02.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.61,0:04:05.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.40,0:04:07.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.27,0:04:08.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.31,0:04:09.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.99,0:04:10.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.57,0:04:13.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么没有发现喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're saying we got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.01,0:04:15.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,婴儿失踪那天\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one saw anything unusual
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.27,0:04:17.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有人看到房子那里有任何异常情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}going on at the house the day the baby disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.85,0:04:21.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果真的是黑暗的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this is truly the Darkness we're talking about,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.12,0:04:22.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.03,0:04:23.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它就不是个婴儿  而是定时炸弹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's more of a time bomb than a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.27,0:04:25.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但它也还是个婴儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but it is still a baby, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.19,0:04:26.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看到的黑暗是个成年人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean the Darkness I saw was an adult,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.55,0:04:29.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它还得长大呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}so it still has to grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.40,0:04:31.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黑暗有无限的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Darkness is almost infinite power.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.22,0:04:35.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道这个情况下"长大"意味着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure what "Growing up" means in this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.30,0:04:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝以前收拾过这东西一次  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, God kick this thing's ass once before, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.06,0:04:40.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  如果他能把鸡尾酒放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it'd be nice if he put down the Mai Tai
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.59,0:04:43.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-来上班就好了  -别指望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and show up for work. - I wouldn't count on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.18,0:04:45.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他可能就在附近  比我们想的要近呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's possible he's around. Closer than we think, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.55,0:04:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么那么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.49,0:04:50.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得他走掉时就已经明确表达了态度了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe he made a fairly definitive statement when he walked away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.70,0:04:56.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉拴着你  小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about those, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.58,0:04:57.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们确定你的问题之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till we know what's going on with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.45,0:04:59.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还指不定能干出什么来\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're still a bit of a wild card, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.77,0:05:09.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不想说  但你们都清楚我们可能需要谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate to point this out, but you both know who we might need
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.27,0:05:11.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来帮忙应付黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to help deal with the Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.63,0:05:12.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别说出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't even say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.65,0:05:15.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是上帝的书记官  他什么事都听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was God's scribe. He did hear about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.64,0:05:17.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这跟说出来有什么区别\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just like saying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.73,0:05:22.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass you all right, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.05,0:05:24.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.31,0:05:26.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还希望你的天使体制能扛过去呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were hoping your angel wiring would fight it off
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.32,0:05:28.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至少能有所减缓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or...slow it down at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.89,0:05:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来我只是跟人类的反应不同而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It appears I simply respond differently from humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.48,0:05:33.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你是人类  你这会儿都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you were you human, you'd be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.20,0:05:34.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而在你身上  这东西越陷越深\N{\fnArial\fs30}With you, it's like it's digging deeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.83,0:05:36.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗威娜是唯一能解除咒语的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Rowena's the only one who can remove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.63,0:05:37.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在尽一切努力找她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're doing everything to find her, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.88,0:05:39.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但目前为止毫无进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}But so far, we got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.31,0:05:40.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,情况越来越糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.36,0:05:50.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是  陛下  我的手下确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, majesty, my operative is certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.68,0:05:52.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您母亲已经找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mother has been found.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.70,0:06:01.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那行动吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.39,0:06:04.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,灭了那个狡诈的贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Annihilate the treacherous bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.67,0:06:14.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她的学习进展飞快\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's making impressive progress in her studies,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.10,0:06:16.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟几天前她还穿着尿布呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}considering just days ago she was in diapers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.70,0:06:17.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看好她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.78,0:06:19.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绝不能让她与宫外的人接触\N{\fnArial\fs30}She speaks to no one outside the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.88,0:06:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果她的法力有我想的一半的强\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she's half as powerful as I think she is,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.68,0:06:23.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一定要她站在我这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want her on my team.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.36,0:06:27.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿玛拉这名字挺好听的  是您给起的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara's a pretty name. Did you name her?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.42,0:06:30.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是可爱的珍娜那么喊她\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what the lovely Jenna called her,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.77,0:06:33.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但阿玛拉却吸食了她的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just before Amara sucked out her soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.98,0:06:36.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在让她看什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we have her watching now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.50,0:06:39.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希特勒纽伦堡演讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hitler's Nuremberg speeches.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.90,0:06:41.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,翻译好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had them translated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.47,0:06:46.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿玛拉  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara, sweetie?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.30,0:06:50.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你如果想可以休息一下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can take a little break if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.51,0:06:53.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,保姆说你学得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nanny said you're doing very well with your schooling.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.02,0:06:58.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你在新家待的开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to be happy in your new home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.41,0:07:00.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管你要什么  不管什么时候要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you want, whenever you want it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.81,0:07:02.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you just have to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.46,0:07:05.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只想要你保护我  别让他抓到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want you to save me, from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.11,0:07:07.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}From God?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.58,0:07:09.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他对我的宝贝姑娘很坏  是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been very mean to my little girl, hasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.71,0:07:12.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-他骗了我  -他很狡猾\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He tricked me. - He's a wily one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.77,0:07:15.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他把我关了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sealed me away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.04,0:07:19.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他究竟怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how exactly did he manage that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.65,0:07:22.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.78,0:07:23.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.02,0:07:27.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你很幸运  我是个国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a very lucky girl. I'm a king.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.91,0:07:31.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要说有谁能保护你不受那个无赖神祇的伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if anyone can protect you from that rascally deity,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.16,0:07:32.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is I.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.56,0:07:33.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.03,0:07:35.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"谢谢你  克劳力叔叔"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Thank you, uncle Crowley."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.52,0:07:47.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"怎么会这样"  我一直在自问\N{\fnArial\fs30}"How did this happen?" I kept asking myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.89,0:07:50.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,巫术本是骄傲大胆的职业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witchcraft was a proud and adventurous calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.36,0:07:53.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但大巫师团却容许它堕落崩溃\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the Grand Coven let it collapse in disgrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.99,0:07:56.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,女巫们懦弱地隐藏于黑暗之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cowardly witches hiding in shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.18,0:07:59.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟当年我们被成千上万地烧死绞死啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we were being burned or hung by the thousands.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.75,0:08:01.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这抑制了我们的热情\N{\fnArial\fs30}It put a lid on our enthusiasm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.71,0:08:04.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,胡说  那是领导不力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nonsense. Poor leadership.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.63,0:08:06.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们族类应该得到复兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our people deserve a renaissance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.92,0:08:08.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在找精英中的精英\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm looking for the best of the best
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.85,0:08:10.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,离开大巫师团\N{\fnArial\fs30}to leave the Grand Coven
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.69,0:08:12.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,加入我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and join me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.32,0:08:14.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}in...the...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.33,0:08:16.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,超大巫师团\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mega Coven.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.91,0:08:25.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们听到了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear what I said, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.58,0:08:30.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天呐  看看这都几点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My...look at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.96,0:08:33.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说过我手里有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I mention I have in my possession
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.67,0:08:35.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,, 《诅咒之书》吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Book of the Damned?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.37,0:08:41.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  疯修女艾格尼丝写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, written by crazy sister Agnes herself,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.25,0:08:42.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,写在自己的皮肉上\N{\fnArial\fs30}on her own flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.53,0:08:46.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它蕴含的秘密让我成为了自然之力  姑娘们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its secrets are making me a force of nature, girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.44,0:08:49.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自然之力啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}A force of nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.41,0:08:51.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你愿把这些秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you'd share these secrets
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.61,0:08:54.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,与超大巫师团共享吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the...Mega Coven?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.08,0:08:56.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一向乐于施于\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always been a giver.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.58,0:09:01.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能做军官吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there a chance I could be an officer?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.66,0:09:04.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在大巫师团就做到了纠察长\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the Grand Coven, I never made it past sergeant-at-arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.22,0:09:08.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你都想不到自己能得到怎样的好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea the rewards headed your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.63,0:09:13.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.97,0:09:17.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.58,0:09:41.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力  快接啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Crowley, pick up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.58,0:09:43.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都给你留了十数条留言了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've left you a dozen messages.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.18,0:09:45.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他为什么不接电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why isn't he answering the phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.50,0:09:49.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为他是个混蛋  这都不是新闻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he's a dick, and that's not breaking news.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.68,0:09:52.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他肯定盯着罗威娜呢吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gotta have Rowena in his sights, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.26,0:09:54.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她可是想杀他啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, she did try to take him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.72,0:09:57.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不会把罗威娜给我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not gonna deliver Rowena to us
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.19,0:09:59.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就为了让她解除咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}just so she can lift the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.47,0:10:02.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他会宁可让咒语在我身上肆虐\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd rather let it do whatever it's gonna do to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.69,0:10:04.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-他肯定有所图谋  -当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's gotta be up to something. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.25,0:10:06.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再说一次  不是新闻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again, not breaking news.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.87,0:10:09.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,梅塔特隆也不见踪影\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron is also off the grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.94,0:10:12.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在密苏里州布莱恩偷了你的车  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stole your car in Blaine, Missouri, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.20,0:10:12.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.93,0:10:15.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  没有任何跟一辆破烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, uh, no accidents, incidents, violations,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.76,0:10:17.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,78款大陆马克5有关的车祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}or anything remotely interesting involving
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.32,0:10:20.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事故  违规或有趣事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}a crappy '78 continental mark v.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.96,0:10:22.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得那车很破吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think it's crappy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.38,0:10:27.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,旁观者清\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eye of the beholder.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.76,0:10:29.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.93,0:10:33.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他避世几世纪\N{\fnArial\fs30}A shut-in for centuries,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.44,0:10:34.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,之前是上帝的书记官\N{\fnArial\fs30}former scribe of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.57,0:10:37.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,按理说不该很会开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't think he would be a good driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.38,0:10:38.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样吧  我找找他可能去的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I'll look for unusual occurrences
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.65,0:10:39.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有没有什么异常事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}at places he might hang out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.49,0:10:46.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.32,0:10:50.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,梅塔特隆可能去的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Places Metatron might hang out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.22,0:10:55.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他喜欢华夫饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he loves waffles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.26,0:10:56.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,试试有华夫饼的地方吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could try places that have those.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.97,0:11:00.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那么整个国家的每家餐馆喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so, every restaurant in the entire country.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.39,0:11:09.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.59,0:11:15.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass? Cass, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.99,0:11:20.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事  放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy! Easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.98,0:11:21.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.07,0:11:27.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.61,0:11:30.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.21,0:11:33.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟什么相比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relative to what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.45,0:11:35.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道自己在哪吗  今天哪天\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know where you are? What's the date?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.71,0:11:37.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.73,0:11:40.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,据时之初已经过了几十亿年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Several billion years from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.90,0:11:42.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,起来吧  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.93,0:11:43.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,起来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.50,0:11:48.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我好像在一个搅拌机里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like I was... inside a blender
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.53,0:11:53.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还设成了做番茄酱果泥的档\N{\fnArial\fs30}that was set to puree for a tomato salsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.26,0:11:55.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是那只番茄喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're the tomato?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.82,0:11:57.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在这个比喻里  是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In this analogy, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.39,0:11:58.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.80,0:12:03.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  刚刚怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, what was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.39,0:12:04.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你吓死我们俩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You scared the crap out of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.98,0:12:06.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我大部分时间都昏过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I blacked out for a lot of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.39,0:12:08.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.73,0:12:11.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  我没招架住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. It overwhelmed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.22,0:12:14.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我控制不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I couldn't control it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.69,0:12:18.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们把他扶起来吧  起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get him up. Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.86,0:12:23.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.04,0:12:26.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我们得找到那个女巫  -嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We gotta find that witch. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.61,0:12:28.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我能帮什么忙  -不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What can I do to help? - No, no, no,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.39,0:12:30.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你坐好  休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just, uh, sit there and take a breather,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.16,0:12:31.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让自己恢复一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}try and put yourself back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.83,0:12:33.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.83,0:12:36.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我尽力吧  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do my best. It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.16,0:12:42.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有那些声音好困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's difficult with these voices.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.65,0:12:46.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有幻音了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now there are voices?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.06,0:12:49.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些声音叫你伤害别人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are these voices telling you to hurt someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.47,0:12:53.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  伙计们  我能听到天使无线电\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Guys, I'm... I'm hearing angel radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.07,0:12:56.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说话的人很多  他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a lot of chatter. They're...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.52,0:12:59.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们逃走之后  他们一直在找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been looking for me ever since I escaped,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.25,0:13:01.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还在满世界找罪犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}as well as scouring the earth for the perp.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.71,0:13:06.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是"犯罪者"的俚语\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's slang for "Perpetrator."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.92,0:13:08.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  多谢解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.85,0:13:11.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在找哪个特定的"罪犯"吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, a-any..."perp" in particular?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.81,0:13:12.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,梅塔特隆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.44,0:13:15.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们投入了双倍人力找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're doubling the effort to find him, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.19,0:13:18.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们如果想找到他  就得赶快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we need to get hold of him, we better do it soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.20,0:13:19.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  别让上帝小分队抢先了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, before the God squad does.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.71,0:13:21.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  重要的事先做\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, first thing's first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.53,0:13:26.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听听这个  可能有谱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to this. May be something here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.57,0:13:29.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丹佛一家埃塔咖啡厅中  三位女顾客的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, in Denver, three women were at this Café Elta,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.64,0:13:31.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,服务员  无缘无故地\N{\fnArial\fs30}when their waiter, for no apparent reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.35,0:13:33.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刺死了其中一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}stabbed and killed one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.02,0:13:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一人生还  第三名消失不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}One survived and the third vanished
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.22,0:13:39.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而家具都自行绕着她移动开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}after furniture seemed to slide around by itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.24,0:13:41.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.89,0:13:45.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,埃塔咖啡厅的调查谁负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, who's your lead on the Café Elta investigation?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.33,0:13:49.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(埃塔咖啡厅发生凶杀案)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.98,0:14:23.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你似乎很困惑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.58,0:14:25.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有烦恼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Troubled.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.79,0:14:28.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝把我关起来后创造了这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}God did all of this after he locked me away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.89,0:14:31.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道有这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know it was so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.15,0:14:33.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都是为满足他自己的自大\N{\fnArial\fs30}All for his own ego.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.23,0:14:35.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管他创造了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no matter what he made,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.12,0:14:37.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都不是他那么对我们的借口\N{\fnArial\fs30}that doesn't excuse what he did to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.41,0:14:39.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.45,0:14:40.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.55,0:14:43.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得专注于我们的目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must stay fixed on our purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.23,0:14:46.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就连我们也不能撤销已经发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even we cannot undo what's already done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.19,0:14:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但随着你成长起来  愈发强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}But as you grow and become stronger,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.78,0:14:54.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你将明白你真正的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}your true destiny will become clear to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.16,0:14:56.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你长大就会成为我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am what you are becoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.76,0:15:00.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们比上帝更加强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we are mightier than God.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.07,0:15:05.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还没睡呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in bed yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.57,0:15:07.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet. Soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.47,0:15:10.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还在学习呢  真乖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Working on your studies. Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.24,0:15:12.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,学到什么有意思的了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Learning anything interesting?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.72,0:15:16.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好像有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.87,0:16:02.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天堂情况不妙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty bad in heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.40,0:16:04.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  楼下怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. How 'bout downstairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.31,0:16:06.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别跟我提\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, don't get me started.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.97,0:16:08.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,警报作响了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alarms go off?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.24,0:16:09.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你都不会相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.70,0:16:11.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我们也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, right? Us, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.36,0:16:13.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.25,0:16:15.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.34,0:16:16.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's big.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.09,0:16:19.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟上帝一样大  跟路西法一样大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big as God. Big as Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.36,0:16:21.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们那边采取什么行动了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They doing anything about it on your end?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.94,0:16:22.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,完全没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zip.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.83,0:16:24.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,楼上呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How 'bout upstairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.79,0:16:26.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一切照旧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, business as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.14,0:16:29.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,按理说该有个什么行政命令之类的  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd think there'd be an executive order, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.29,0:16:31.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,国王躲起来不知干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king's holed up doing who knows what.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.90,0:16:32.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汉娜死后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After Hannah died,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.89,0:16:35.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天堂就一团乱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven's pretty much been a suck sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.00,0:16:38.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道谁受苦吗  我们这种基层的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who gets squeezed? It's grunts like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.92,0:16:41.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  就打个卡  有你没你都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, punch a clock, you're expendable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.22,0:16:50.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们两家一向是对头\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, our two operations will always butt heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.54,0:16:51.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当初设置就是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the set up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.24,0:16:54.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.95,0:16:55.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可能会丢了工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could be out of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.94,0:16:58.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我们被干倒  它掌权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. We get knocked out, it takes over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.04,0:17:01.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总得有人做点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's gotta do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.38,0:17:03.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-谁  -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Someone? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.88,0:17:06.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果管理层不作为  就得靠小人物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If management won't, it's up to the little guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.77,0:17:10.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  有道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I hear ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.47,0:17:12.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,敬人民当权  朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power to the people, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.57,0:17:17.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也不算人民啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not actually people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.60,0:17:18.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我什么意思的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.96,0:17:30.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-警局  -谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sheriff's Station- Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.87,0:17:33.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-探员  请  -交给我们吧  嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Agents, here you go. - We got it. Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.73,0:17:35.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.01,0:17:42.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,女士们共进午餐出了岔子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, ladies lunch goes south
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.74,0:17:45.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一名浑身硫磺味儿的服务员\N{\fnArial\fs30}when a waiter, who reeks of sulfur,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.22,0:17:46.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,持刀袭击了你们  杀死一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}attacks with a blade, killing one of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.73,0:17:48.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而请你吃饭的红发女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}while the redhead who invited you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.71,0:17:51.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大喊了一句拉丁文  就无影无踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}yells something in latin, disappears,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.02,0:17:53.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而家具则叠成了一摞  是这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the furniture forms a pile. That about right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.61,0:17:57.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道一个恶魔为什么要袭击三个女巫吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any idea why a demon would wanna attack three witches?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.73,0:17:59.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.89,0:18:01.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  服务员被一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. The waiter was possessed
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.50,0:18:03.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,企图行刺罗威娜的恶魔附身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}by a demon assassin who was gunning for Rowena,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.68,0:18:05.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为她企图杀她儿子克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}since she tried to kill her son Crowley,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.86,0:18:07.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而他恰好是地狱之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}who just so happens to be the King of Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.68,0:18:12.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么觉得你们不像警察说的  是联调局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do I think you're not F.B.I. like the police said?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.72,0:18:13.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,直说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's cut to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.35,0:18:15.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,警方说你吓得\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cops say that you're so scared,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.80,0:18:17.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不想离开这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't wanna leave here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.76,0:18:18.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是该害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you should be,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.34,0:18:20.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为克劳力不仅想要罗威娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause Crowley's not only going after Rowena,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.93,0:18:22.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他也不会放过所有她的女巫朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's going after every witch that she hangs with.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.92,0:18:25.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我不是女巫  -你当然是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I-I'm no witch. - Sure, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.60,0:18:28.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你朋友罗威娜  她在为新巫师团招募吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your pal Rowena, she's recruiting a new coven.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.73,0:18:32.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能那么做  我有权利的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't do this. I have rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.78,0:18:34.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还有假警徽呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have a fake badge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.85,0:18:35.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.45,0:18:39.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鸡骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chicken bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.60,0:18:40.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,巫术袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hex bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.83,0:18:42.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,五芒星\N{\fnArial\fs30}A pentagram.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.95,0:18:45.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still sticking with, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.01,0:18:47.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是女巫吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}not a witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.92,0:18:50.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.02,0:18:52.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说完你想说的之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, before you finish what you're about to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.02,0:18:53.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要知道只有我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}know that we are the only thing
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.27,0:18:55.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,挡在你和克劳力的刺客之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}between you and Crowley's ninjas.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.88,0:18:57.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我又没想伤害他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I didn't try to hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.78,0:19:00.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是个小人物  我什么都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I am nobody. I-I'm worse than nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.72,0:19:02.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是小人物的远方表亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I'm nobody's third cousin
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.33,0:19:04.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从不会被请去吃饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}who doesn't even get invited to dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.18,0:19:05.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.94,0:19:07.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只想知道罗威娜在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just need to know where Rowena is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.97,0:19:09.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.46,0:19:11.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你会占卜吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you do know how to scry, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.24,0:19:14.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,占卜  什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scry? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.28,0:19:17.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是那个意思  定位咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly what you know it is. A locating spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.57,0:19:19.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们女巫用水晶  棱镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you witches use crystals and then prisms
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.84,0:19:22.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和镜子占卜你想找的人的影像\N{\fnArial\fs30}and mirrors to divine images of who you're trying to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.99,0:19:24.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们想找到罗威娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're trying to get our hands on Rowena.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.14,0:19:26.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她如果死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, now with her out of the picture,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.92,0:19:28.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力就没必要追着你不放\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley has no reason to go after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.99,0:19:29.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,懂了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.00,0:19:35.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没带水晶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have my crystals.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.66,0:19:40.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.94,0:19:47.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个也能行吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ought to work, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.18,0:19:50.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我关灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.86,0:19:58.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.06,0:20:01.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.65,0:20:06.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看到她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.89,0:20:11.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她在收拾东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's packing a bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.44,0:20:19.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.22,0:20:21.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有礼物给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a gift for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.74,0:20:24.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准确说  是两份礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.60,0:20:29.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是血吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that...blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.56,0:20:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可能是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.23,0:20:34.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.44,0:20:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(跳跳大叔)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.97,0:20:41.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉我这么虎妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to forgive me for being the tiger mom,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.19,0:20:45.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但用书籍丰富头脑永远不嫌早\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's never too soon to improve your mind with books.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.19,0:20:47.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agreed,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.44,0:20:50.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我更喜欢保姆给我的这本\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I like the one nanny gave me more.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.92,0:20:53.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但丁的《神曲:地狱篇》\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dante's inferno"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.34,0:20:55.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是原版意大利文的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the original Italian.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.95,0:21:02.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,保姆还教你其他我们世界的东西了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has nanny been teaching you other things about our world?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.71,0:21:03.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,教了一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.84,0:21:05.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是很和谐啊  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't work very well, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.08,0:21:08.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝就这样  根本没想清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's God for you. Not really thought out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.74,0:21:10.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么大爆炸的  就是大失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole big bang thing? More of a big bust.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.15,0:21:13.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘭  呯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, boom, bang,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.52,0:21:16.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,繁星  进化  泰勒·斯威夫特\N{\fnArial\fs30}stars, evolution, Taylor Swift.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.69,0:21:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜换你就不会这么做吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing you'd have done things differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.84,0:21:19.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sure will.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.02,0:21:22.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我考虑过很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had a lot of time to think it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.76,0:21:27.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么具体我们可以期待的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any...specifics that we have to look forward to?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.17,0:21:30.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.92,0:21:32.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.78,0:21:40.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodies!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.62,0:22:05.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.42,0:22:09.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not...quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.13,0:22:11.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肉身早就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The meat suit was already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.09,0:22:14.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是里面的灵魂维系了它的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just the soul that was inside it that was keeping it alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.48,0:22:16.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.39,0:22:18.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你  克劳力叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, uncle Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.63,0:22:26.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.20,0:22:39.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去机场\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.03,0:22:41.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心拿包  都是古董\N{\fnArial\fs30}And be careful with the bags. They're antiquities.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.57,0:22:43.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.54,0:22:52.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就这样冲你竖手指  温彻斯特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just my way of giving you the finger... Mr. Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.80,0:22:54.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你估计不是来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't suppose you're here
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.60,0:22:56.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感谢我帮你祛除了该隐血印的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}to thank me for removing the Mark of Cain,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.45,0:22:59.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了  不客气哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}which, by the way, you're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.35,0:23:03.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们再上个台阶吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just take things up a notch.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.27,0:23:04.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.58,0:23:11.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在该知道了  萨穆埃尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you'd know by now, Samuel,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.51,0:23:13.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些东西困不住我多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}these things don't hold me long.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.28,0:23:15.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只需要困住你足够长的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need to hold you long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.90,0:23:18.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,早听说金发更好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they do say blondes have more fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.19,0:23:24.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想查一辆车的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}"To pull up information on a car,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.97,0:23:27.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,选择搜索框\N{\fnArial\fs30}select search box,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.10,0:23:30.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,输入违法行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}type in violations.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.90,0:23:34.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再输入车牌号\N{\fnArial\fs30}And enter license plate number,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.25,0:23:36.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,车型\N{\fnArial\fs30}make..."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.74,0:23:46.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,幸运交配\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fortune nookie,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.26,0:23:50.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亚裔女孩性幻想首选网站\N{\fnArial\fs30}your premiere web site for all your Asian girl fantasies.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.85,0:23:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有几百位美丽的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have hundreds of lovely girls
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.13,0:23:56.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就等着跟你聊天呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}just waiting to chat with you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.77,0:23:59.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全天候恭候\N{\fnArial\fs30}24 hours a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.38,0:24:05.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,幸运交配什么意思啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What could "Fortune Nookie" be?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.10,0:24:12.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.87,0:24:13.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.17,0:24:16.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.50,0:24:18.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.32,0:24:37.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,餐厅里在上死肉身吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cafeteria is serving dead meat suits, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.90,0:24:39.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.40,0:24:41.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会有没魂的疯子在走廊里乱跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}No chance of soulless lunatics roaming the halls.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.18,0:24:44.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人提到甜点了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I hear someone mention dessert?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.17,0:24:46.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,稍等  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a minute, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.92,0:24:50.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们刚刚说到哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, what were we just chatting about?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.09,0:24:54.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝创造人类时  完全搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How when God created mankind, he really screwed it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.36,0:24:55.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,注意语言哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Language!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.27,0:24:58.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原始力量哪能这么说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that any way for a primal force to speak?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.84,0:25:00.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我每次吸食一个灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time I take in a soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.30,0:25:03.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都能深深感到空洞感\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel how much emptiness there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.91,0:25:05.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.17,0:25:08.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝创造了一个让人类受苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}God made a world where people have to suffer,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.83,0:25:11.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,死去的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then they die.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.00,0:25:13.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-真是不幸  -但老实说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Unfortunately. - But Frankly,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.69,0:25:16.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们为什么要活在这样的世界上啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}why would they want to live in such a world?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.55,0:25:20.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我向你的真知灼见致敬  亲亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I salute your insight, cupcake.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.55,0:25:24.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  上帝的计划有很大缺陷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, God's plan is hideously flawed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.19,0:25:25.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你我联手\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you and I together?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.83,0:25:29.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以按照自己的想法塑造世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we can shape things to our own world view.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.22,0:25:32.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个美德像恐龙一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}A place where, like the dinosaur,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.42,0:25:34.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,灭绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}virtue is extinct,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.75,0:25:38.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,空气中都是绝对邪恶的味道的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}where the very air that we breathe is pure evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.28,0:25:39.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢那样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.46,0:25:40.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.13,0:25:46.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果大家都是邪恶的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd really be happy if everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.69,0:25:47.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真就开心了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}was evil?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.32,0:25:52.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实  想起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...actually, now I come to think of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.95,0:25:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果人人都黑暗  被诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}if everyone was dark and damned,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.59,0:25:57.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就不怎么具有挑战性了\N{\fnArial\fs30}wouldn't be much of a challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.48,0:25:59.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看着人类拒绝光明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watching a human reject the light
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.90,0:26:02.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拥抱堕落  那才\N{\fnArial\fs30}and embrace depravity... yes, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.35,0:26:04.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能给人满足感\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's where the gratification really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.96,0:26:06.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从不会觉得无聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never gets old.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.70,0:26:10.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得困惑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This bemuses you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.01,0:26:15.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  坏  天堂  地狱  人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, evil, heaven, hell, people..
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.88,0:26:18.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一切都感觉好渺小\N{\fnArial\fs30}It all seems so unimportant.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.57,0:26:20.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也未必吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't know that I'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.36,0:26:22.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你没看到大局\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you're seeing the big picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.77,0:26:24.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning what exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.81,0:26:28.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猜怎么着  克劳力叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess what, uncle Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.43,0:26:31.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.90,0:26:33.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.12,0:26:46.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,内衣小心点拿  萨穆埃尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind the undergarments, Samuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.61,0:26:48.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都是进口的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imported, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.45,0:26:49.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.99,0:26:51.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is what, dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.71,0:26:52.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}The book!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.43,0:26:54.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,, 《诅咒之书》\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Book of the Damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.26,0:26:57.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,法典在里面  但书不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}The codex is in there, but the book is not.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.16,0:26:58.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,书在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where the hell is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.67,0:27:01.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你当我是傻瓜吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you take me for a fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.72,0:27:05.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会随身带着那两件非凡的宝器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I'd run around with those two spectacularly powerful items
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.74,0:27:07.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把他们放在一起吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}anywhere in proximity.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.62,0:27:09.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们拿到法典了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now we've got the codex
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.72,0:27:11.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有查理的解码\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Charlie's code-breaking,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.54,0:27:14.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以那本书对你也不像之前那么有用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so the book isn't as useful to you as it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.35,0:27:16.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是希望如此吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or so you hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.21,0:27:18.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就钦佩你这点  萨穆埃尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I admire in you, Samuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.57,0:27:20.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这种大胆的乐观主义\N{\fnArial\fs30}That plucky optimism.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.53,0:27:24.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大胆愚蠢的乐观主义\N{\fnArial\fs30}That plucky, stupid optimism.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.29,0:27:25.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  你去找小卡来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, why don't you go grab Cass
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.34,0:27:27.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让红发天使做她该做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}so Florence Nightingale here can do her stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.25,0:27:31.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.28,0:27:46.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你记得我们的协议吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do recall our deal, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.00,0:27:49.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我解除天使的咒语  然后放我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}First I de-spell the angel, then I go free.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.84,0:27:51.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除了一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm, except for one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.78,0:27:54.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的协议没有例外\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were no exceptions in our arrangement.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.08,0:27:56.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,书  那个得拿回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The book. Gonna need that baby back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.32,0:27:58.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的协议里没提到书\N{\fnArial\fs30}The book was never mentioned in our negotiations.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.64,0:27:59.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.99,0:28:02.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的协议是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our deal says...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.14,0:28:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的协议我说什么就是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our deal says whatever I want it to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.93,0:28:09.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要按我的规矩来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna play by my rules
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.41,0:28:14.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你儿子的电话我一键就能拨通\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I have your son on speed dial.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.68,0:28:16.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打给他啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.28,0:28:23.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我死了  你就什么都别想得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I'm dead, you've got a big fat pile of nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.10,0:28:26.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,永远别想拿到书了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No book ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.53,0:28:29.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你那个光环坏掉的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your friend with the bent halo?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.50,0:28:33.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他会疯到口吐白沫死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}He goes foaming-at-the-mouth mad and dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.10,0:28:35.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.83,0:28:42.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.01,0:28:45.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,背负重担\N{\fnArial\fs30}So burdened.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.91,0:28:49.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我祛除了血印后发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened precisely when I removed the mark?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.17,0:28:51.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,书里没细说\N{\fnArial\fs30}The book wasn't specific.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.97,0:28:55.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是读了不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I read quite a bit of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.29,0:29:00.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩·温彻斯特又往这世界上释放了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What new hell has Dean Winchester unleashed
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.93,0:29:02.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么新灾难\N{\fnArial\fs30}upon the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.26,0:29:06.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-迪恩  -怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean! - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.85,0:29:08.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我找不到小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I can't find Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.96,0:29:11.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-什么  -他不在  他挣脱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - He's not there. He... he... he broke free.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.72,0:29:12.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.84,0:29:38.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真荒谬  开车到处兜圈找你们的落跑天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}So absurd, driving in circles looking for your unhinged angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.88,0:29:40.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没在兜圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not driving in circles, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.38,0:29:42.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们锁定了他的手机GPS\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're locked onto his phone's G.P.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.13,0:29:44.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正在追踪他的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're tracking his location.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.09,0:29:46.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我完全听不懂你刚刚说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea what you just said,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.73,0:29:48.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我肯定能做得更快\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm sure I could do it faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.24,0:29:49.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, maybe you could,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.69,0:29:51.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但那样你就得施咒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you would have to do a spell,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.61,0:29:53.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就得给你解下手铐\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means we would have to take the cuffs off,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.41,0:29:57.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we are not going to take the cuffs off.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.46,0:30:00.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,毫无信任吗  我们不是一个团队吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no trust? Are we not a team?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.55,0:30:01.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.77,0:30:14.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您找我  陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sent for me, sire?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.99,0:30:16.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想表扬你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to commend you
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.33,0:30:19.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在前任因不适离职后\N{\fnArial\fs30}for how well you've stepped into your new role as nanny
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.25,0:30:21.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好地接替了保姆一职\N{\fnArial\fs30}after the last one became indisposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.51,0:30:24.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不适  她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Indisposed"? She's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.55,0:30:27.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总之  你似乎很适合这种工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}At any rate, you seem to be cut out for this kind of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.79,0:30:30.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿玛拉显然很喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara clearly responds to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.86,0:30:32.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她像看食物一样看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She looks at me like she wants to eat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.20,0:30:35.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她看什么都像食物  别往心里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wants to eat everyone. Don't take it personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.17,0:30:39.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,陛下  我没有带孩子的经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty, uh, I have no experience with children.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.97,0:30:41.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能做别的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, is there nothing else I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.73,0:30:43.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来是不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently not,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.42,0:30:46.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟你没能刺杀我母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}seeing as you failed to assassinate my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.44,0:30:49.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不想再失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd hate to be disappointed twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.97,0:30:52.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.91,0:30:57.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.76,0:31:00.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿玛拉似乎长得很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara seems to be growing in leaps and bounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.65,0:31:02.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不仅是成熟度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just in maturity,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.26,0:31:03.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,力量和自信都大涨\N{\fnArial\fs30}but in strength and confidence, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.87,0:31:05.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不希望她失控\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want her to get out of hand
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.08,0:31:06.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还不能确信她的忠心\N{\fnArial\fs30}before I'm sure of her loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.42,0:31:10.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要停止对她的无度喂食\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to stop overfeeding her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.66,0:31:12.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但您说要满足她的一切要求的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you said to give her whatever she wants
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.66,0:31:14.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不论她何时需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}whenever she wants it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.69,0:31:16.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我改说法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now I'm saying something different, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.22,0:31:18.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.25,0:31:21.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可不能培养出自以为是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't want a generation of entitled,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.39,0:31:23.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小胖丫头啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}pudgy kids, do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.08,0:31:24.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we do not.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.38,0:31:27.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉她\N{\fnArial\fs30}So simple inform her
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.54,0:31:30.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要减少她的灵魂食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we're cutting back on her soul food.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.21,0:31:33.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样更加健康\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, uh, it's the healthier choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.20,0:31:35.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您要我去跟她说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to tell her this?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.02,0:31:44.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是她的保姆吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are her nanny, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.91,0:31:48.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-这...  -如果你不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well... - 'cause if you're not the nanny,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.09,0:31:49.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}then what are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.46,0:31:51.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.57,0:31:54.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,插在竿子上  烤到时间尽头\N{\fnArial\fs30}roasting on a spit until the end of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.04,0:31:59.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我尽力吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll, uh, do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.91,0:32:00.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.48,0:32:06.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你系围裙真好看\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you look wonderful in an apron.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.13,0:32:12.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(卡西迪奥)
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.18,0:32:22.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟两个这么高大威猛的小伙子一起公路旅行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't think a road trip with two such strapping lads
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.06,0:32:23.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,居然能这么无聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}could be this tedious.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.56,0:32:26.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们唱唱歌吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we have a wee sing-song?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.05,0:32:27.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.92,0:32:29.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只能怪我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have myself to blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.84,0:32:32.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就不该跟温家人做协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should never make deals with Winchesters,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.38,0:32:35.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们似乎从来不能履行协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}since they seem unable to hold up their end of the bargain.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.58,0:32:36.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning what?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.42,0:32:40.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是萨姆  克劳力和我之间的那件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, just that thing between Sam, Crowley, and myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.38,0:32:45.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  她在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What's she talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.59,0:32:49.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你肯定是知道萨姆跟我做了协议  他杀我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, surely, you knew Sam made a deal with me to kill my son
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.87,0:32:52.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,交换我祛除你胳膊上的该隐血印吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I removed the Mark of Cain from your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.93,0:32:57.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,血印祛除了吗  是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, is the mark gone? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.55,0:32:59.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力死了吗  没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Crowley dead? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.78,0:33:03.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he didn't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.57,0:33:06.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不知道诶\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.92,0:33:09.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想告诉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I was gonna tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.53,0:33:11.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不用说  那事最终无果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously, nothing ever came of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.07,0:33:13.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就觉得没那个必要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I-I figured there was no point, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.64,0:33:14.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No point, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.25,0:33:17.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我明白迪恩的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I mean, I see what Dean's saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.00,0:33:20.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你遵守了承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wee pal Castiel wouldn't be in this pickle
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.11,0:33:22.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的朋友卡西迪奥就不会陷入这麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you'd done what you'd promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.17,0:33:24.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果克劳力已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would've had no reason to cast the attack dog spell
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.29,0:33:26.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也没必要施下疯狗咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}if Crowley were already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.49,0:33:27.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent point.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.92,0:33:29.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没那么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not my point.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.78,0:33:31.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆知道我怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam knows my point.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.65,0:33:33.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,关键词是秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keyword... secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.10,0:33:39.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很高兴我们聊起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, well, I'm just glad I got the conversation flowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.04,0:33:43.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,家庭关系我最擅长了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family relations are a speciality of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.30,0:33:47.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-他停下了吗  -嗯  是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did he stop? - Yeah, he stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.22,0:33:49.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(卡西迪奥)
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.24,0:33:50.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他就在附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's close.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.45,0:34:31.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.45,0:34:35.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他肯定就在附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, he's gotta be around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.15,0:34:37.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我往前走  你们走另一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'll head up the street, you guys head the other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.09,0:34:38.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开玩笑吗  我穿着高跟呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you joking? I'm in heels.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.44,0:36:00.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干点正事儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.92,0:36:48.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass! Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.08,0:36:50.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.92,0:36:53.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是你  是咒语的影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, this isn't you. It's the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.21,0:36:54.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能克服的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can beat this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.09,0:36:56.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.10,0:36:58.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放开她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.22,0:37:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快走  快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.00,0:37:11.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.59,0:37:12.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会没事的  兄弟  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be okay, buddy, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.01,0:37:28.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.51,0:37:40.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,需要我提醒你这是杀女巫的子弹吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I need to remind you these are witch-killing bullets?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.65,0:37:41.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把咒语终结了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finish it!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.18,0:37:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦  知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.30,0:37:48.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.41,0:38:02.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.94,0:38:03.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.36,0:38:15.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧  起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.65,0:38:17.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.62,0:38:24.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.72,0:38:25.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.51,0:38:30.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.97,0:38:32.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.00,0:38:40.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我确信你绝对有意遵守我们的约定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure you had every intention of honoring our deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.75,0:38:43.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但何必冒险呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why take chances?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.24,0:39:05.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该继续敷着\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}You should keep applying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.96,0:39:08.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢了  老妈  你只管一直上啤酒就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, mom. You just keep the beers comin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.02,0:39:10.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.14,0:39:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的心情言语无法表达\N{\fnArial\fs30}There aren't words.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.40,0:39:14.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对  是没什么可说的  小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. There aren't words, Cass,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.22,0:39:15.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为没这个必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause there's no need.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.77,0:39:17.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是被咒语控制了  没关系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were under a spell. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.33,0:39:20.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  但你们都抓到罗威娜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but you had Rowena.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.09,0:39:22.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我  你们...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of me, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.20,0:39:23.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗  小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Cass,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.91,0:39:26.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们拿到法典了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've got the codex.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.17,0:39:28.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是个开头  这能稍稍减慢罗威娜的速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a start. You know, it'll slow Rowena down some.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.16,0:39:30.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,假如我们杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we'd killed her,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.47,0:39:32.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就永远也找不到《诅咒之书》了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Book of The Damned would've been lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.14,0:39:33.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,另外  我们还有更要紧的事要操心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, we got bigger fish to fry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.13,0:39:35.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.38,0:39:36.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does she want?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.98,0:39:39.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最大的问题是  她现在在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the big question is, where the hell is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.98,0:39:43.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我能治好你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I can fix that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.31,0:39:46.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不不  没关系的  小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. No, no. It's fine, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.34,0:39:48.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再说了  我也是该打\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, I had it comin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.40,0:40:07.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,特此下令...等等等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hereby command and decree... blah, blah, blah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.92,0:40:10.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,永生永世被挂在钩子上...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hung on hooks for all eternity...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.79,0:40:12.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,内脏挖走...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Entrails removed...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.76,0:40:39.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.29,0:40:49.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.83,0:40:51.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然了  小乖乖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, poppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.24,0:40:55.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但这样吧  也许我们应该先聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But tell you what, maybe we should have a chat first.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.82,0:40:59.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.98,0:41:01.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hungry.

